#: src/features/analytics/Install.tsx
msgid "Add the YuvaAnalytics library of the Yuva package and configure it once at launch. .yuvaScreen counts a SwiftUI screen; in UIKit, call YuvaAnalytics.screen when a screen appears. Without a connection, events wait on the device for up to 72 hours and arrive with their own times."
msgstr "Legg til biblioteket YuvaAnalytics fra Yuva-pakken og sett det opp én gang ved oppstart. .yuvaScreen teller en SwiftUI-skjerm; i UIKit, kall YuvaAnalytics.screen når en skjerm vises. Uten tilkobling venter hendelsene på enheten i opptil 72 timer og kommer fram med sine egne tidspunkter."

#: src/features/analytics/Install.tsx
msgid "Add yuva-analytics from JitPack and configure it once in Application.onCreate. TrackScreen counts a Compose screen. Without a connection, events wait on the device for up to 72 hours and arrive with their own times."
msgstr "Legg til yuva-analytics fra JitPack og sett det opp én gang i Application.onCreate. TrackScreen teller en Compose-skjerm. Uten tilkobling venter hendelsene på enheten i opptil 72 timer og kommer fram med sine egne tidspunkter."

